{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33980","headline":"鲁望以轮钩相示缅怀高致因作三篇 一 · 皮日休","name":"鲁望以轮钩相示缅怀高致因作三篇 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"角柄孤轮细腻轻，翠篷十载伴君行。\n捻时解转蟾蜍魄，抛处能啼络纬声。\n七里滩波喧一舍，五云溪月静三更。\n牛衣鲋足和蓑睡，谁信人间有利名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}